{"about_the_game":"This is a trading and city building strategy game.<br />\r\nYou control a trader who develop a village.You earn money by trading the produced products myself or others to other villages.<br />\r\nFor example crap,cloth,wood,milk,book,sword,shield,shell,gem<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere is villagers who creates buildings in the village where the trader is located.They fight,produce,eat,work depending on your order.<br />\r\nAnd The same is true for Another Villagers in other village.You can develop other villages by trade.<br />\r\nIf you set up bars and arenas in the developed other village, residents enter there and you can make money.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMoney makes jealousy. Thieves will attack the developed village, so let's prepare defense forces such as cannons and warriors.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe basis of trade is to buy cheaply and sell it high.<br />\r\nEvery village, every seasons,every timing , products which villagers want to have are different.<br />\r\n Let's sell the right item at the right time.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe success or failure of your village depends on the appropriate management of risks and resources.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/699370?t=1505241355","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/699370?t=1505241355","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/699370/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1505241355","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/699370/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1505241355","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"This is a trading and city building strategy game.<br />\r\nYou control a trader who develop a village.You earn money by trading the produced products myself or others to other villages.<br />\r\nFor example crap,c